{"3902610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OctoCraps", "steam_appid": 3902610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OctoCraps, the craps you never asked for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Roll eight-sided dice, place your bets, and try your luck in this fast, unpredictable twist on a casino classic.  The table looks normal enough—until it doesn’t.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odds updated for 8-sided dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice use physics for randomness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 takes the place of 7 from standard craps</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OctoCraps, the craps you never asked for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Roll eight-sided dice, place your bets, and try your luck in this fast, unpredictable twist on a casino classic.  The table looks normal enough—until it doesn’t.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odds updated for 8-sided dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice use physics for randomness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 takes the place of 7 from standard craps</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "OctoCraps — the craps you never asked for! Roll eight-sided dice, place your bets, and try your luck in this fast, unpredictable twist on a casino classic.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902610/ad65a5b6a79ff46416d62c66ffd29bf5c49bd332/header.jpg?t=1755874033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902610/4f272f15ebb6ddd42441e008521d19ebf1969172/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755874033", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.